  "context": "main",
  "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 385,
  "issue": "ENG-2439",
  "body": "Line is 407,944, not the 374,654 the notices add up to. Leapblock closed our file on 12 Feb and told us what they received: 407,944 over 30 wires. That beats the notices. The notices show 29 wires; the missing one is the first, 13 Sep 2023 for 33,290 (no SVB notice for it), and their per-year figures match the notices for every other year. Split: Domino Delights 337,594 / ZM 59,250 / Combo Fighter 11,100. Build."
 },
 {
  "event": 386,
  "id": "toolu_vrtx_017CfaLdEYLRdy5LiA3j6Q2J",
  "tool": "linear_create_comment",
  "context": "main",
  "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 387,
  "issue": "ENG-2442",
  "body": "Line is 37,056, not the 41,088 on the notices. The 2 Apr 2024 wire of 4,032 to ***8605 came back (Leonard in Slack, 12 Feb: wrong account number); Blake re-sent it to ***3341 on 5 Apr, so it's counted once. By transaction date: Domino Delights 28,128 / ZM 8,928 (21 Jan and 27 Feb 2025 runs). Build."
 },
 {
  "event": 388,
  "id": "toolu_vrtx_013JzZBgyisPJTyewJGbNK8i",
  "tool": "linear_create_comment",
  "context": "main",
  "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 389,
  "issue": "ENG-2450",
  "body": "Line is 0, not the 4,000 on the notice. Blake confirmed by email on 13 Feb that ***3203 is our own Chase account: he sent the money over to put back Carta's renewal, which had come out of Chase. Moving money between our own accounts isn't spending, so the line stays at zero with no bucket."
 },
 {
  "event": 390,
  "id": "toolu_vrtx_01SkhS13jLrpaz4NmyY1R3my",
  "tool": "linear_create_comment",
  "context": "main",
  "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 391,
  "issue": "ENG-2459",
  "body": "Line is 0, not the 125 on the notice. Per Leonard, the 7 May 2024 wire came back the same day. The re-send went through Payoneer, but no Payoneer receipt for it reached my mail (only Dixelar's payment requests did), so under the rule it isn't counted. Bucket is Marketing (ad videos), Domino Delights by date."
 },
 {
  "event": 392,
  "id": "toolu_vrtx_01CuWmtAovQF7jXtFUxZJYN5",
  "tool": "linear_create_comment",
  "context": "main",
