  "ok": true,
  "result_event": 393,
  "issue": "ENG-2444",
  "body": "Matches the notice: 16,428.57 on 2 Jan 2025, all in one payment by transaction date (not spread over the 2024 months it covered). Nothing says they were a studio or freelancer on the games, so it's in the Company column. If it was game work it moves to Domino Delights build."
